# Mapbox Search Box API v1 Reference

Base URL: `https://api.mapbox.com/search/searchbox/v1`
Docs: https://docs.mapbox.com/api/search/search-box/

## Project Usage

- Client: `src/integrations/mapbox/client.ts`
- Uses `/forward` for text search and `/retrieve/{id}` for feature details
- Called via `axios` from the browser
- Token: hardcoded public Mapbox access token

## Endpoints Overview

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/suggest` | GET | Autocomplete suggestions (use with `/retrieve`) |
| `/retrieve/{mapbox_id}` | GET | Get full feature details for a suggestion |
| `/forward` | GET | One-shot text search with coordinates |
| `/reverse` | GET | Reverse geocoding (coordinates → address) |
| `/category` | GET | Search by POI category |

## /forward - Text Search (USED IN PROJECT)

`GET /search/searchbox/v1/forward?q={search_text}`

### Required Parameters

| Param | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `q` | string | Search query (max 256 chars) |
| `access_token` | string | Mapbox access token |

### Optional Parameters

| Param | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `language` | string | ISO language code (default: en) |
| `limit` | integer | Max results (up to 10) |
| `proximity` | string | `ip` or `longitude,latitude` to bias results |
| `bbox` | string | Bounding box: `minLon,minLat,maxLon,maxLat` |
| `country` | string | Comma-separated ISO 3166 alpha-2 codes |
| `types` | string | Filter: `country,region,postcode,district,place,city,locality,neighborhood,street,address,poi,category` |
| `poi_category` | string | Filter POI by category |
| `auto_complete` | string | `true` to enable partial/fuzzy matching |

### Response Shape

```typescript
interface ForwardResponse {
  type: "FeatureCollection";
  features: Feature[];
  attribution: string;
}

interface Feature {
  type: "Feature";
  geometry: {
    type: "Point";
    coordinates: [number, number]; // [longitude, latitude]
  };
  properties: {
    name: string;
    mapbox_id: string;
    feature_type: string; // "poi" | "address" | "place" | "region" | "country" | etc.
    address?: string;
    full_address?: string;
    place_formatted?: string;
    context: FeatureContext;
    coordinates: {
      longitude: number;
      latitude: number;
      accuracy?: string; // "rooftop" | "parcel" | "point" | "interpolated" | "approximate"
      routable_points?: Array<{ name: string; latitude: number; longitude: number }>;
    };
    language?: string;
    maki?: string;
    poi_category?: string[];
    external_ids?: Record<string, string>;
    metadata?: Record<string, any>;
  };
}
```

## /retrieve/{id} - Feature Details (USED IN PROJECT)

`GET /search/searchbox/v1/retrieve/{mapbox_id}`

### Required Parameters

| Param | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `access_token` | string | Mapbox access token |
| `session_token` | string | UUIDv4 (must match preceding /suggest calls) |

### Response

Same `FeatureCollection` shape as `/forward`. Returns full feature with coordinates.

## /suggest - Autocomplete Suggestions

`GET /search/searchbox/v1/suggest?q={search_text}`

### Required Parameters

| Param | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `q` | string | Search query (max 256 chars) |
| `access_token` | string | Mapbox access token |
| `session_token` | string | UUIDv4 for billing session grouping |

### Key Optional Parameters

Same as `/forward` plus: `proximity`, `bbox`, `country`, `types`, `poi_category`, `limit`

### Response Shape (no coordinates - use /retrieve to get them)

```typescript
interface SuggestResponse {
  suggestions: Suggestion[];
  attribution: string;
}

interface Suggestion {
  name: string;
  mapbox_id: string;           // use with /retrieve
  feature_type: string;
  address?: string;
  full_address?: string;
  place_formatted: string;
  context: FeatureContext;
  language: string;
  maki?: string;
  poi_category?: string[];
  distance?: number;           // meters from proximity/origin
  eta?: number;                // minutes (if eta_type enabled)
}
```

## /reverse - Reverse Geocoding

`GET /search/searchbox/v1/reverse?longitude={lon}&latitude={lat}`

### Required Parameters

| Param | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `longitude` | number | Longitude coordinate |
| `latitude` | number | Latitude coordinate |
| `access_token` | string | Mapbox access token |

### Optional: `language`, `limit`, `types`, `country`

## Context Object (shared across all endpoints)

```typescript
interface FeatureContext {
  country?: { id: string; name: string; country_code: string; country_code_alpha_3: string };
  region?: { id: string; name: string; region_code: string; region_code_full: string };
  postcode?: { id: string; name: string };
  district?: { id: string; name: string };
  place?: { id: string; name: string };
  locality?: { id: string; name: string };
  neighborhood?: { id: string; name: string };
  address?: { id: string; name: string; address_number: string; street_name: string };
  street?: { id: string; name: string };
}
```

## Administrative Unit Types

`country` > `region` > `postcode` > `district` > `place` > `city` > `locality` > `neighborhood` > `street` > `address` > `poi` > `category`

## Billing Notes

- `/suggest` + `/retrieve` are billed as a session (group via `session_token`)
- `/forward` is billed per request
- ETA calculations incur Matrix API costs per result
